{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_10_end","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_10","title":"彌撒“君王”","storyCode":"ZT-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"1871af0d1b4fa1d38872d3ec0143ad55889f7f440e717180bc59901a3339b58a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g4_towerroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃拉菲亞女孩背靠著書桌的桌腳盤坐著。她在膝蓋上放了一個枕頭，將一本書攤開在枕頭上，燭火照亮她低垂著的柔和側臉。\n她就那樣窩在角落裡看書，安靜地，認真地。\n小女孩從書頁間抬起頭，對上薇薇安娜的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安，你似乎並不驚訝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我看到了門口的影子，知道不是別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，在這個小小的房間，只能靠燭火照明，你因此花了很長的時間觀察陰影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看的書是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《最後的騎士》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正看到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒數第三章。無名的騎士身後是巨大而孤獨的燈塔，海浪將他和他的坐騎羅辛南特一遍又一遍逼退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們一同怒吼，向著漆黑如夜的巨浪發起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝鋒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉呀，你不要劇透啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個晚上，你把這一段反反覆覆看了好幾遍，直到抱著枕頭在地上睡著，直到媽媽後半夜回來捏滅了蠟燭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你怎麼知道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她當然知道，這個房間、這個姿勢、這本書……\n這本就是她的記憶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇薇安娜倒退至門口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，薇薇安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段人生裡有我的問題，而我正要去尋找答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"興許，興許還來得及打開下一扇門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你開過多少扇門了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百多……我已經記不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想……找到一種更好的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，如果依然找不到呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“更好”，能像數學題那樣清楚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你進過的那一百多扇門裡，可能爸爸媽媽多過了一段無人打擾的安寧生活，可能媽媽離開的時候比實際的要晚幾年……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算起來，是不是其實也有過“更好”的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，你依然覺得遺憾呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼確定還會找到更好的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，找到了又能怎麼樣呢？該發生的不該發生的，都已經發生了呀……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸老是說，如果當年在金盞花小巷，他再等十分鐘，也許就能等到媽媽，也許一切都會有所不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“可惜命運不會給人重來一次的機會。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，就算真的等到了，爸爸依然會離開的，不是嗎？除了多留給媽媽下一次告別和哭泣，故事不會有任何的變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你其實希望找不到更好的答案？因為這樣就能說服自己，“本來就沒有更好的辦法”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，這不是跟爸爸一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要繼續看書了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安，你很失望，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1121_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快離開吧，你還來得及開啟下一扇門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坍塌的動靜更近了。\n薇薇安娜轉過身，她此刻已經能看清，那些不知為何正在崩毀的門，像是連續倒塌的骨牌，像是記憶中徹夜的煙火……\n由遠及近地撲向這座施彤領中央最高的高塔。\n父親平常極少來這裡，而在節日的夜晚，作為選帝侯，他更需要接待絡繹不絕的賓客，身為侍女的母親則要忙碌至次日淩晨。\n她就這麼縮在房間的角落，用書本遮住一切聲響……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“坍塌”已至眼前，崩毀清晰可見。\n難以名狀的危機感湧上薇薇安娜心頭。她突然有強烈的預感，那些門的倒塌，不僅僅是一次次失敗找尋的具象化。\n如果這個小小的房間被吞沒，有什麼東西會真的被抹去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當那名騎士衝向無邊的浪潮中時，你覺得他，想的是戰勝這片大地嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會離開。"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇薇安娜轉身，將那個小小的女孩擋在身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從走上那段旋梯開始，我甚至說不上來到底發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許這是每個來到“始源之角”的人都會經歷的過程。被內心深處的死結牢牢捆縛，迷失在混沌的漩渦裡，與它成為一體……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安，我要對你說些什麼？應該說，我要對自己說些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"燭火渺茫，燭火總隨夜風飄搖……今後總有潑向你的污濁，無可挽回的遺憾，你將囿於尋找與失去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你務必要相信，你曾憧憬的故事，並非虛幻的傳奇，或者可笑的符號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你曾真切見過能照亮整片大地的光芒。哪怕無人從被它照亮的路上行過，那光芒仍不可動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許你不是那光芒。但你亦曾，為守護它而拔劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜·德羅斯特，別忘記，你是一名騎士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“坍塌”已至，黑暗一瞬間吞沒了薇薇安娜。\n相比最後的騎士，海洋與天空依然是具象的，可薇薇安娜並不清楚自己的敵人到底是什麼。\n她突然發現自己不再能感知到手中的劍，也無法點燃燭火。恐懼像是怒潮或者汪洋，在一瞬間將她洗刷至麻木。\n可是很快，自己就慢慢平靜了下來，甚至沒來由地感到輕鬆，那些悲傷與恐懼不再令人難以自拔……\n因為它們在，一點點消失……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那些崩毀的門與門的罅隙裡，有什麼事物正在吞吃自己的情緒？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無數的影像，真實與幻覺糾纏著，如詭異但柔軟的繭殼束縛了薇薇安娜……自己必須，握住什麼。自己能夠，握住什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"耀眼的光點亮了薇薇安娜的眼眸。她赫然發現——\n穿越苦暗與荊棘，成為歷史，成為傳說……騎士的劍槍，從未被時代磨損的光芒——\n此刻，竟投映在她的手心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她握緊。揮舞。以騎士之姿！\n光芒轉盛，璀璨的金色漫過一切，奔向時空的盡頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g12_multispace"},{"type":"narration","text":"旋梯和所有的門都已經消失。\n薇薇安娜看著自己空空如也的手，可剛才沙礫般的觸感是如此真實。她閉上眼睛，反覆確認自己在黑暗中最後見到的景象——\n邪祟的生物與難以名狀的聲、光、形、色互為軀體，它們構成了“混沌”。插在那混沌中的，騎士的劍槍熠熠生輝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛握住的，是它的……投影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇陛下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對！“始源之角”外的混沌裡，存在更可怕的災異……這裡不能坍塌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g11_thronesworld"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗萊蒙特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那對雙子……最終還是你阻止了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的成功得益於你，我的失敗依然由你造就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開。帕維永正在崩解……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，還是為了命結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在荒域中取得的成果足以讓人敬畏，但你的語氣還是那麼討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我難道要感激你讓它“物盡其用”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫，我從未見你如此不甘……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須取回它。未來，它將作用於卡茲戴爾的存續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖得太久了，已經過去了多少年……巫妖王庭早就該離開萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“放逐”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗萊蒙特，早在路德維格大學那間密室，你本有機會向我施展這項巫術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照塵世的時間，過了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百三十來年。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此刻，遲到的巫術跨過漫長的時間，跨過同行者的歧路，重新施展。\n灰色的大雨飄揚著向上，整個空間看似因此傾倒。盡全力施展的“放逐”，反而柔和得充滿別樣的美感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗萊蒙特，我從未見你如此癡愚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命結是巫妖繫在帷幔中的繩結，與你們的生命共振。你不可能感受不到它的存在。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨滴連綴成弦，在虛空中躍動，它們隨根系處的弗萊蒙特呼吸。\n只是如常地呼吸，可久違的充盈感自靈魂深處傳來。\n弗萊蒙特彷彿只是隨手摸了摸口袋，卻發現遺失的鑰匙一直安靜地躺在觸手可及的角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是早就還給你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗萊蒙特，命結恆常，巫妖因此無限積累生命的厚度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡不會追上你，它只是追上了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":"avg_npc_1116_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何對你來說，承認它卻如此艱難？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"整個空間都被淋濕的那一瞬，巫妖的絲弦終於完全包裹住了巫王，它們擁抱、纏繞，看上去像是一具棺槨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只是來道別嗎？弗萊蒙特啊，我的摯友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這座高塔，為何仍如此矮小……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"淡漠了年歲的巫妖只是站著，沒有任何表情，他的面前空無一物。\n“放逐”的痕跡在褪去，每一根絲弦都已感受不到巫王的氣息，旋角猙獰的卡普里尼像是從未存在過。\n唯有最後那句囈語仍在空中飄盪……\n它重得如一句詰問，輕得像一聲嘆息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g11_thronesworld"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知何時，阿爾圖羅已經站在了高塔前。\n她怔怔地聽著，無人能回應那句詰問，而嘆息聲也已散盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您最後的“遺言”，這就是……“答案”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自此後，萊塔尼亞再無巫王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你果然在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科……"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科抬頭看，眼前的黑色巨塔一點點失去它的形狀和色彩，褪色的源石晶簇在虛空中一點點斂去痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王，已知最為強大的心靈，依然無法對抗注定的消亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科舉起了銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的雙子女皇已經直接介入了事件，整個案件的影響已經遠超本次任務最初的外交風險評估等級。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下的事件結束後，我將以最快的速度與教宗伊萬杰利斯塔十一世取得聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此之前，你的自由將被限制，直至我們得以返回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科聽到了回答。\n這個他再熟悉不過的遠親，並未像往常那樣，圍繞著情感邏輯與親屬關係進行毫無意義的拉扯。她只是疲憊地拒絕，然後走向他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以扣下扳機，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻，在這片名為荒域的混沌裡，我的面前只有你，我沒有可以演奏的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我丟失了我的樂聲。我不會逃跑，也沒法耍弄任何的把戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的邏輯存在疏漏，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅徑直越過了費德里科，像是完全沒有聽見他的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g12_multispace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"始源之塔……正在坍塌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫死透了，他撐起來的泡泡當然也會跟著破掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的不在了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才放下狠話沒多久，就又不相信自己所見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……能殺死他的，依舊是赫琳瑪特和伊維格娜德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽起來倒是沒那麼失望，蠻好的。終有一天你會比今天更清醒地意識到……能在命運面前轉身離去，是多麼幸運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有什麼東西從弗萊蒙特的袍子底下垂了下來。\n黑鍵忽然意識到，剛剛弗萊蒙特的身形在向他走來，影子卻留在了原地。\n那道影子包裹住了搖搖欲墜的王座，順著階梯一路延伸，漸漸地纏住整個塔身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的影子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"影子……哈，別被你的眼睛騙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到的，是我的線，我的命運，我……的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了赫爾昏佐倫之外，你是第二個見過我真正模樣的萊塔尼亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在用命弦支撐崩塌的空間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是對巫妖而言，命弦……不是比血肉之軀更重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫做的混帳事不少，有一點卻說得很對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湮滅的時刻就快到了。要是真讓荒域滲出去，把萊塔尼亞炸成一片窟窿，什麼巫妖，什麼萊塔尼亞人，大家一起完蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃吧，小羊崽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡馬上就待不了活人了。不想被死亡追上的話，趕快離開這座墳墓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陰影爬滿了老巫妖的身體。\n只一瞬間，那團影子就裂成了數不清的絲線。\n它們飛向每一片墜落的磚石，每一處虛空的裂痕。\n可震動依然在加劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……來不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崩潰……近在眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g15_kingsthrone"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片空間……也會下雨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這是弗萊蒙特閣下的線。他身上總是齊齊整整的，我還沒見過他和別的巫妖一樣，長出這麼多的線頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“始源之角”撐不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得在這個地方完全崩塌之前，退回現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，我們至少需要一條路……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法術的光輝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇之聲薇薇安娜·德羅斯特，本該與兩位陛下並肩而戰，請原諒我……來得有些遲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，你的光比以前要亮一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我……見到了真正的黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛，我行走在無盡的螺旋樓梯上，見證了一個又一個可能的現實的崩毀，險些……就要被混沌吞噬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後在某個時刻，在黑暗之中，我窺見了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不知道我窺見的是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可能是最深的恐懼，最大的空洞，徹底的失序，那是……我們無法理解的災異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們蟄伏在混沌之中，我已感知到它們的注視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特，伊維格娜德——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人正在向我們飛快地行進。它們即將侵入我們所知的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"線突然摸不到了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，不對不對——所有的線都在一起震動！震得很大，所以才會摸不到連著“始源之角”的那一根！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊辛……萊辛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（前所未有的噪音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德女士，梅耶爾先生在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他該不會……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還……沒死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，我的線都亂了，離這麼近也很難感知到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有老師……剛剛我們的線還是連著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和其他巫妖在這一邊，他在那一邊，我們往兩個方向各自拉扯著現實和“始源之角”，好不容易達成了一個平衡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在不好了，一下子全都不對了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1126_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們……不再發出聲音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止是這些死去的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音樂……音樂停了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫……巫王……雙子女皇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施彤……領……瑪……瑪爾塔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……整片劇場都安靜了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的樂章……所有的聲音都消失了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿有人施放了一個最大規模的靜音法術。\n剛剛還在狂亂的噪音中不能自已的人們，都停止了表面的躁動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"痛苦和憤怒等激烈的情緒正從他們臉上褪去，取而代之的是一種深刻的恐懼。\n但這種恐懼也並未長久地停留。當它擴張到了極致，就成了一種空白。\n有什麼東西正從虛空中滲出來。\n它正在侵蝕和消解一切。\n秩序崩潰了，而混亂也沒有留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……虛無之中的災異，侵蝕萬物的空洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些眼睛注意到了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪就連巫妖的線都無法穩定兩邊空間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……敵人有多可怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是能摸得到的敵人就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最可怕的是，那些敵人都未必真的會到我們面前呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒域之所以叫荒域，是因為那裡是空的，是無。一個什麼都沒有的地方，反過來侵入我們的現實……你覺得會發生什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得立刻讓老爺子他們出來，然後想辦法把通道堵上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德，你和老爺子還能互相聽見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……時間不夠。我沒辦法立刻在一片狼藉中找到正確的線頭。沒有線連通兩邊的話，裡面的人是出不來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失敗……了嗎？赫琳瑪特……不可能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到這裡。想一想……你心底裡最牽掛的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫……赫琳瑪特……我不能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特應該給了你一條最後的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是她回不來的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是……時間到了，金律法衛沒有收到新的……新的號令……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“湮滅”崔林特爾梅將是最後的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這一點上，我認同她的選擇。我們都可以死在這裡，萊塔尼亞……還有萊塔尼亞之外的人們不能一起淪陷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，繩結動了。裡面的人還沒有放棄。再堅持一會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德，繩結能算是你說的，連通兩邊的“線”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧……我在努力了，要是兩邊的連繫能更穩定一些，我和老師說不定能圍繞繩結上的法術，來穩定通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得靠你了，黑鍵……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g11_thronesworld"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺到萊辛他們了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離我們很近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是什麼好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現實與荒域被再一次拉近了，就和疊在一起的兩個泡泡……不，和一個泡泡被放在一根針上差不多。再近一點，泡泡就該全碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我能拽著繩結，再走出去一些……您和埃芒加德小姐是不是就可以穩定通路？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"離泡泡邊緣遠一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該死，小羊崽子，你會被虛無抓住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"繩結在手中顫動。\n黑鍵能感受到，那隻緊握著這條白色布帶另一端的手。\n因為長時間握劍和揮劍，那隻手已接近麻木。\n力氣花光了，源石技藝也差不多枯竭了，傷口不再流血，疼痛漸漸模糊。\n而使命與意志，雖然仍在大腦深處頑強地跳動，但在語言崩潰之後，這些念頭也很難再被清晰地描摹。\n我們是因何走到這裡？因何戰鬥到現在？我們因何而生，又將因何而死？\n虛無迎了上來。不見前路，沒有退路，唯有虛無。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑鍵正在下墜。\n而墜落的盡頭……將什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"不。那裡有東西。\n是一片溫暖的白色，散發著柔和的光芒。\n黑鍵突然意識到，他還沒來得及找到那名拉大提琴的薩科塔，但他已經得到了答案。\n他與他之間的情感與回憶，不是任何人，任何源石技藝……甚至命運賦予的。\n最美好的部分就在那裡，從來都只屬於他們自己。\n那是一個笑容。\n一段琴聲。\n一抹……希望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"narration","text":"命運總是從我們身上奪走很多東西，幸好，我還擁有愛與恨的能力。\n崔林特爾梅的晚霞、開得熱烈的金盞花、眼神如湖泊般瀲灩的孩子，還有她那對溫柔的父母……\n我愛我看不見的這些風景，這些人。它們照亮了我，也會驅散遮住更多人眼簾的那些晦暗。\n可是我也恨。\n恨花期那麼短暫，恨那些無形的意志束縛著我愛的一切。我的孩子啊，自從回到萊塔尼亞後，你總是皺著眉頭……\n你問我：“新的秩序在哪裡，又是否一定會比昨天與今天更好？ ”\n我沒辦法回答你，我只是決定那麼去做了。\n愛意味著責任，而恨同樣會帶來責任。你要為你已經改變的和沒能改變的負責。\n我的孩子，我的朋友，如果你愛，如果你恨，那麼你將背負的，遠比你想像的多得多……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"narration","text":"我懷疑。\n懷疑是一種怯懦嗎？還是一種勇敢？\n倘若是怯懦，我為什麼將那些怪物的血肉摻進聖餐，願意將希望寄託於另一種信仰？\n倘若是勇敢，我又為什麼在最後那一刻縮回了手，那些鮮活的醜陋的生物組織讓我恐懼？\n六十年，我看不到遙遠的樂園，但生活在清晰地崩毀著。我不願禱告，我只能禱告。\n誰寫就了律法，誰確保它的純潔與完整？我問信仰，而信仰緘默。\n我不敢說我已剔除了深種於腦中的那些妄念……不，我仍懷疑。\n修道院正在遠去，我在衣袍的褶皺裡發現了一小撮種子，克萊芒啊，我的孩子，哪怕死在路上，我也會為它們找一塊濕潤的土地。\n我懷疑我們的律法。懷疑讓我怯懦，懷疑讓我勇敢，懷疑會推著我一直走……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g12_sewer"},{"type":"narration","text":"我其實討厭酒精，可我突然發現自己離不開它了。那時候尤利婭已經死了很久。三年？五年？\n我的人生有兩次逃離。\n拉特蘭，所謂的聖城並沒有那麼美好，空氣中的甜味和喧鬧掩蓋了不平等，黎博利與薩科塔的差異似乎不值得討論。\n來到萊塔尼亞的時候，我依然很年輕。我見到了與白牆截然不同的烏雲，無數人在巫王的統治下慘死。\n我是第一個衝進始源之塔的士兵，可我並不相信巫王被打倒後一定有一個全新的萊塔尼亞。\n尤利婭說得不對，我從來都是個悲觀的人。失望讓我清醒，失望讓我不得不去找尋並捍衛那些少之又少的美好。\n可最後，我和我的失望妥協了，我成了這副模樣。\n如果靈魂終有歸屬，想必我死後，無法和尤利婭去到同一個地方。\n我最後應該還是保護了一些人吧？我想問問那個執行者先生，問問尤利婭，問問我自己……\n我還算不算，英雄？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"我好像踩在了海灘上。\n黏膩的海灘。奇異的海洋生物竟然奏響了我的琴弦。\n那是我聽過最乏味的心聲，我什麼答案都沒能得出。海浪將我推離了那片海灘。\n那時我二十歲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"我好像踩在了沙地上。\n柔軟的沙地。我的對面是名為長生軍的戰士，他與黃沙同歲。\n我每拉響一個音符，對方盔甲的縫隙中都會傳來歷史的呼嘯。\n那時我十五歲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"narration","text":"我好像踩在了草坪上。\n……雨中的草坪。我正在參加人生的第一場葬禮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我站在墓碑前，看著客人們逐一上前向母親的遺像致哀。\n我明明聽見了那些聲音——悲傷、唏噓、遺憾、嘲弄、憎恨和幸災樂禍……可為什麼，他們的表情，卻都能夠保持最得體的哀傷？\n唯有以最真實的感情面對死亡，才是對生命的尊重。不是嗎？！\n母親，我沒忘記你說過的話，我還能時時聽見你的心聲。我還需要多大的勇氣，才能掙脫日復一日的自我拉扯，勇敢地走出那一步？\n自由是那樣難能可貴。\n可是死亡……死亡為什麼如此輕易？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等到清醒的時候，我已經完成了那場演奏。\n費迪，這一次，我依然沒能控制好自己的樂聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅？","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你是如此敬畏死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡如此輕易就抹消了人的存在，為一切情感畫上休止符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些直面了真實卻最終走向死亡的人們，那些旋律讓你讚嘆，但更多的時候你恐懼、憤恨、懷疑，你——寂靜而沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在到達那個未來前，在無限的漫遊裡，你還需要演奏多少次？你還需要為自己譜寫多少空白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無聲亦為奏，譜曲必有結。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巫王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你唯一的真實。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你如此脆弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅睜開了眼睛。\n她像是走完了很長的一段路。時間如一條河流，人們是順流而下的旅人。可是自己為什麼在一步一步地，向著來路跋涉？\n她覺得自己變成了一個破碎的容器，而在那千百樣人生裡體驗過的堅定的愛、濃烈的恨、莫大的勇氣、難以排解的失望和愧疚……\n都在一點一點地流失……直到只剩下空空的自己。\n不知何時，她已離開荒域，走入了廣場上的人群。人們面無表情地經過她的周圍，而她怔怔地站立，表情與所有人別無二致。\n阿爾圖羅抬頭，從那個她從未離開過的草坪上抬頭……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頭頂有烏雲經過，一滴雨落在了她的臉上，像是一滴晶瑩的眼淚。\n——為她那來不及承認的，脆弱和悲哀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪爾塔，我的愛人，是你將我從那段最黑暗的日子裡撈上來，鼓舞我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，我卻只能帶著對你的思念苟活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該去找你嗎？哪怕我們的貴族老爹不同意，至少你得知道，我對你的愛意從未有半分動搖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瑪爾塔……愛人，是你將我從那段最黑暗的日子裡撈上來，鼓舞我去做自己渴望的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今，我卻只能帶著對你的思念苟活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我應該去找你的。哪怕我們的貴族老爹不同意，至少你得知道，我對你的愛意……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"偌大的塔前劇場，每個人口中都在重複念叨著什麼，那些詞句的內容滿溢著喜怒哀樂，可卻聽不出任何語氣，沒有一絲一毫的情緒波動。\n他們看不見阿爾圖羅，他們看不見任何人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身影交錯時阿爾圖羅的手臂被一個三角鐵砸中，她幾乎握不住自己的琴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特……赫琳瑪特……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要拋下我一個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的，費德里科。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……明智的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"場面太過混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"群體性的幻覺……從路德維格大學奏鳴塔到塔前劇場，這是第三次發生此類情況，但情形比此前更加嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"性質並不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王消亡後，“始源之角”已經崩毀，而荒域即將坍塌向現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們並非單純地陷入幻覺，而是……他們無法對抗混沌的侵襲，那些豐沛而深刻的情感正在離他們而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在聽到的，是他們還僅剩的，最為強烈的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律樂章、條律、道德、典範的藝術……“秩序”無法幫助人們對抗無孔不入的混沌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當最後一絲情感都流失殆盡，廣場上的所有人將變成一具又一具空殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得喚回他們的理性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，只有你是特殊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於大部分人而言，沒有情感，何來意志？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有情感，唯有情感本身能讓人保持“自我”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所說，這些人已經瀕臨某種“空白”，而你仍要演奏他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。這一次，我演奏的對象，是我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會將我的情感，分享給所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這聽起來接近於另一種形式的共感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而阿爾圖羅，你過去曾多次試圖破壞拉特蘭的共感根基。你早已背離了拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"背離拉特蘭嗎？或許我不在乎……可從過去到現在，我都沒有主動選擇過離開拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是並不認同律法所代表的秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於共感……它的局限，正是我對未來所有想像的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更詳細的，我日後會對你說明。現在，看看身邊這千千萬萬的人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們曾用力地哭，也曾熱烈地笑，直到這最後的時刻，仍在拼盡全力挽留著生命中的那一絲感受……哪怕自己已經意識不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論是巫王，還是尤利婭，他們同樣偉大而可敬，也同樣殘缺而脆弱。這是我們的“自我”，人之為人的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須變得強大，而無從消弭的脆弱，也應有容身之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，我們才需要那個並肩站立、共享悲喜的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感受著自己，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，唯有我心懷希望，我才能還給人們希望；唯有我愛，我才能還給人們愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我願以這微末的自尊，聯結所有的，悲與喜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的琴聲……有些人向你靠了過來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個年輕貴族的臉上有了表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是情緒回流的反應。已經空掉的心靈，需要一點時間重新接納一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行動評估：阿爾圖羅，你的行動有利於穩定局面。執行者費德里科·吉亞洛將協助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你停下演奏前，不會有任何人干擾到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小的間歇後，阿爾圖羅再次扣緊琴弓，樂章即將進入高潮段落，琴弦擦出的泛音像是翩躚的蝶。\n她還來得及抬頭看一眼天空，巨大的裂隙懸浮於雙塔之上，那是黑暗洞開的眼眸，可它的周圍，依然有未被完全侵蝕的晚霞。\n晚霞多麼美麗啊，像是砸斷鐐銬時的，火光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那個薩科塔的琴聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繩結又開始動了，我感覺到黑鍵了！埃芒加德——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在忙了在忙了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"絲線從巫妖翻飛的衣袍間飛入雲層。\n風開始重新穿行，凝固的雲也恢復了流動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"緊跟著是一陣不太劇烈的震動，就如列車進站時，地面傳來的小小顛簸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通道穩定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要保持清醒，他們很快就能出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾，醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特一定交代了你什麼。你得想起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的……號……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好你的樂器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……赫琳瑪特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……我的回憶？琴聲在讓我看見……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"低音號很沉，你累了，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就說出來。你只是個孩子，沒必要把什麼都藏在心底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕？很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人都怕我，那些比你年紀更大的貴族，更兇狠的術師，他們都怕我。他們覺得，只要我想，我的劍隨時都能從身後刺穿他們的胸膛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不怕？還想成為我的女皇之聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的，想好了？不，你說想好了也沒用。你根本就是個孩子，被你的親人送到這裡來的時候，你還什麼都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別……別抓著我的腿。你這樣，我會沒法拿劍的。好吧，我就當你累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待會你就得去自己的房間練習吹奏樂器和源石技藝。還有貴族在外面等著覲見，今天我不會再過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想小睡一下……或玩一下也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想當女皇之聲的話，也得等你拿得動手上的低音號再說。還有，別說什麼是魯珀坎的期望讓你必須成為女皇之聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有辦法選擇自己的出身，但至少應當能選擇什麼時候轉過身去。我們身上的責任，不該是別人逼我們扛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“赫琳瑪特”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你自己想好了，決定了要以什麼身份站在這裡，你才有資格吹響我交給你的號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我記得的。我得吹響我的號。我得告訴金律法衛，所有人都得救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓您失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的陛下……赫琳瑪特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g12_multispace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……米夏埃爾，幹得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴聲……好清晰。阿爾圖羅小姐在幫我們？不，不止……她在幫助所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在這一刻，我們的心靈是鮮活的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g12_multispace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們依舊能夠戰鬥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……外面的景象？是通道嗎？我們可以從那裡出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，去找弗萊蒙特，確保在這片空間裡的人都能回到地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您和赫琳瑪特呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是履行我們一直以來肩負著的責任……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……把威脅擋在萊塔尼亞之外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於，只剩下我們兩個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的旋律……已經奏響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉澤洛特，你的盾將能罩住雙塔和雙塔之下的所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的劍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的命運，早在踏入此地之時就已注定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是在更早之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1115_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當“始源之角”脫離我和弗萊蒙特閣下的計劃，在崔林特爾梅的中心降臨的時候，我就只能這麼選了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希爾德加德，你……不想再問我什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊……你的反應，果然與我預想的沒有絲毫差別啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"通道在迅速地閉合。\n黑暗一擁而上，填補了本不該存在的縫隙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而裹藏在最濃的黑暗之中，同樣正在向她們，以及她們身後的現實撲過來的，還有無數蠢蠢欲動的眼睛。\n金色與黑色擦肩而過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫曾在此地建起了一座塔，在混亂無序中確立了秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作為繼承了赫爾昏佐倫的力量，又殺死了赫爾昏佐倫的人，我自然也能超越赫爾昏佐倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虛無中的眼睛，混沌中的威脅，恐懼凝結的實體，不存在於現實的敵人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“邪魔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，赫琳瑪特，萊塔尼亞的女皇，萊塔尼亞最鋒利的劍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我在此宣布，你永遠無法入侵我的國度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"熾烈的光芒從赫琳瑪特的劍尖綻放。\n在她的法術引領下，散落虛空的“始源之塔”的碎末重新凝聚，建成了一座新的“塔”。\n這座豐碑橫亙於現實和荒域之間，擋住了黑暗中窺視著一切生機的眼睛。\n光芒映照下，現實中的雙塔，塔下的萬民，還有塔上的雲霞融化在了一起，成了一團模糊又溫暖的漣漪，在她身後漸行漸遠。\n赫琳瑪特沒有再回頭。\n她的法術，她的劍，還有她的身軀，都成了這座漆黑豐碑的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們都說，你是不可能戰勝的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今時今日，抑或在遙遠的將來，我將殞命在此，化作混沌的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫琳瑪特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這絕不是……萊塔尼亞和萊塔尼亞人的命運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g9_towersquare_arrived"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚……霞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的貴族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真……真美啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……天空中有什麼在落下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"形狀不規則的烏雲裂開了。\n清晰可見的金色從黯淡的天幕中透出來，飄灑在每個人臉上。\n萊塔尼亞的人們剛從渾噩的夢中甦醒，就被這片降臨在雙塔之間的金色雲霞奪去了目光。\n不知道誰第一個開始的，人們開始情不自禁地彈奏手中的樂器。\n不再是金律樂章，也不是什麼耳熟能詳的經典曲目。\n全新的旋律，伴隨著五彩的源石技藝光輝，應和著萬人激動的心聲，自發地在雲霞之下流淌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你看到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的新英雄……不，新的神明降生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二次殺死赫爾昏佐倫，化解了萊塔尼亞的災厄，將希望與生機帶回這片大地的人，萊塔尼亞唯一的女皇，“永恆恩典”伊維格娜德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她將徹底取代始源之塔，成為萊塔尼亞天空的主宰，比晚霞還要絢爛的……“崔林特爾梅之金”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們欣喜若狂，而她如願以償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這位新生的神明……她在落淚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金色的光輝實在太過燦爛，足以奪走所有人的目光。而那顆淚珠滑落她的臉龐，永遠地留在了黑暗之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
